# Byte-exact text across platforms: golden traces compare byte for byte, and shell scripts
# break under CRLF. Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite both.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.safetensors binary
